<%- include('head', {title:'Import products'}) %>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/import.css"><script src="/import.js" defer></script>
<div id="import-app" data-job-id="<%= jobId %>">
<div class="toolbar"><p class="muted">Review catalogue changes before applying them.</p><div class="import-actions"><a href="/admin/products">Products</a><a href="/admin/products/import">Import history</a><a href="/admin/products/import/template.csv">Download CSV template</a></div></div>
<details class="panel"><summary>CSV and image import guide</summary><p>Required columns: SKU, name and category. New products default to draft. Existing products are matched by SKU; choose update mode to edit them.</p><p>For image_filename, use an exact ZIP basename such as <code>scissors.jpg</code> or an existing <code>id:UUID</code> import reference from the <a href="/admin/media" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Media Library</a>. Separate additional_images with <code>|</code>. External image URLs are rejected.</p><p>Blank optional cells preserve existing values. Select “Clear this field when blank” beside a mapped field to clear it deliberately. Use the preview to resolve unknown categories and review each change before confirming.</p></details><ol class="import-steps" aria-label="Import steps"><li>Upload CSV</li><li>Map and validate</li><li>Review and confirm</li><li>Import results</li></ol>
<div id="import-notice" class="notice" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></div>
<section class="panel" id="upload-panel" <%= jobId ? 'hidden' : '' %>><h2>Start a product import</h2><p>Upload a UTF-8 CSV (maximum 4 MiB). Match products by SKU. You can attach an image ZIP after mapping columns.</p><form id="csv-form"><label>Products CSV<input type="file" name="file" accept=".csv,text/csv" required></label><button>Upload and map columns</button></form></section>
<section id="job-panel" hidden><div class="panel"><div class="toolbar"><div><h2 id="job-title">Product import</h2><span id="job-status" class="badge"></span></div><a id="report-link" href="#">Download result report</a></div><div id="import-stats" class="import-stats"></div><label id="progress-label" for="import-progress">Progress</label><progress id="import-progress" value="0" max="1"></progress><p id="progress-detail" class="muted"></p></div>
<section id="mapping-panel" class="panel" hidden><h2>Map columns</h2><p>Check suggested mappings. Ambiguous columns require your choice. Blank cells preserve existing values unless you choose to clear them.</p><form id="mapping-form"><div id="mapping-fields" class="import-fields"></div><div class="two-cols"><label>Import mode<select name="mode"><option value="add">Add only — skip existing SKUs</option><option value="update">Update only — skip new SKUs</option><option value="upsert">Add and update</option></select></label><label>Unknown categories<select name="unknownCategories"><option value="">Choose individually below after validation</option><option value="skip">Skip all unknown categories</option><option value="create">Create missing categories</option></select></label></div><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="replaceImages">Replace existing galleries with imported images</label><div id="category-mappings"></div><button>Save mapping and validate</button></form><hr><h3>Image ZIP (optional)</h3><p>Use exact image basenames in the CSV (no folder paths). ZIP maximum 64 MiB. Uploads use small chunks; choose the same ZIP to retry an interrupted upload.</p><form id="zip-form"><label>Image ZIP<input type="file" name="file" accept=".zip,application/zip" required></label><button class="secondary">Upload image ZIP</button></form><p id="zip-progress" role="status"></p></section>
<section id="sample-panel" class="panel" hidden><h2>First three records</h2><div class="table-wrap" id="sample-records" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="CSV sample records"></div></section>
<section id="review-panel" class="panel" hidden><h2>Review import</h2><p id="review-description">Review changes, warnings and errors below. No products change until you confirm.</p><form id="row-search" class="filters"><label>Search rows<input name="q" placeholder="SKU, name or error"></label><button class="secondary">Search</button><a id="errors-link" href="#">Download errors CSV</a></form><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>CSV row</th><th>SKU / product</th><th>Result</th><th>Changes</th><th>Warnings / errors</th></tr></thead><tbody id="import-rows"></tbody></table></div><nav class="pagination" aria-label="Import preview pages"><button id="rows-prev" class="secondary" type="button">Previous</button><span id="rows-page"></span><button id="rows-next" class="secondary" type="button">Next</button></nav></section>
<section id="confirm-panel" class="panel" hidden><h2>Confirm catalogue changes</h2><p>Only valid rows will be applied. Invalid rows are retained in the result report as failed. Changes are saved in small batches. Keep this page open, or return to this import to resume.</p><form id="confirm-form"><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="backupAcknowledged" required>I have downloaded a database backup before applying updates.</label><button>Confirm and import valid rows</button></form></section>
<div class="import-actions"><button id="validate-button" hidden>Continue validation</button><button id="resume-button" hidden>Resume import</button><button id="pause-button" class="secondary" hidden>Pause after this batch</button><button id="cancel-button" class="secondary" hidden>Cancel import before writes</button><a href="/admin/products/import">Back to history</a></div>
</section>
<% if (!jobId) { const history = Array.isArray(jobs) ? jobs : jobs?.items || []; %><section class="panel"><h2>Import history</h2><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>CSV file</th><th>Status</th><th>Created / updated / failed</th><th>Open</th></tr></thead><tbody><% history.forEach(job=> { %><tr><td><%= job.filename %></td><td><%= job.status %></td><td><%= job.counts?.created || 0 %> / <%= job.counts?.updated || 0 %> / <%= job.counts?.failed || 0 %></td><td><a href="/admin/products/import/<%= encodeURIComponent(job.id) %>">Review import</a></td></tr><% }) %><% if (!history.length) { %><tr><td colspan="4">No imports yet. Start by uploading a products CSV.</td></tr><% } %></tbody></table></div><% if (jobs.pages > 1) { %><nav class="pagination" aria-label="Import history pages"><% if (jobs.page > 1) { %><a href="?page=<%= jobs.page - 1 %>">Previous</a><% } %><span>Page <%= jobs.page %> of <%= jobs.pages %></span><% if (jobs.page < jobs.pages) { %><a href="?page=<%= jobs.page + 1 %>">Next</a><% } %></nav><% } %></section><% } %>
</div><%- include('foot') %>
